  "releaseNotes": "Publishes the public CreateUseSiteOptionsMonitor<TOptions> API for isolated middleware use-site overrides. It rebuilds the normal registered options/configuration baseline, runs registered PostConfigure steps, applies the local use-site override afterwards, runs registered validation, supports configuration reload and OnChange, reapplies the local override after reload, and leaves global options unchanged. Also includes one-record-per-request traffic logging on ASP.NET Core HTTP Logging, shared NetLib IP normalization in client-network features, Eigenverft.NetLib.Infrastructure 1.0.20264.61091, and the neutral Eigenverft package icon.",
